abstract: >-
  District-level dataset and analysis code on household solar energy adoption in Botswana,
  compiled from the Statistics Botswana 2022 Population and Housing Census report
  "Utilisation of Green Energy Among Households in Botswana" (2024). Supports two companion
  manuscripts: a spatial-statistics study of solar-cooking adoption patterns (submitted to the
  Journal of Energy in Southern Africa) and a machine-learning benchmarking study testing
  whether Random Forest and Gradient Boosting models outperform a linear baseline on this
  small administrative dataset (prepared for Energies, MDPI). Data files are released under
  CC BY 4.0; code files are released under the MIT License (see LICENSE-DATA.txt and
  LICENSE-CODE.txt).
